Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《大白鲨4：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,停止什么？ 我什么也没做\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Stop what? I'm not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,噢！\很受伤，你做得对\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ow!\That's hurt, Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把它剪掉吗？ 我控制不住自己\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Will you cut that out? I can't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.99,0:03:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一样鬼鬼祟祟的 就像你父亲一样\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You're as sneaky as your father was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直是偷西红柿的贼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He was the tomato thief of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道你在做什么 -我饿了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I know what you're doing. - I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,让我吃完晚饭 在你吃之前把这些剁碎\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Let me finish dinner before you eat it. Chop these.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，伙计们\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sorry, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，妈妈，明晚我们要去 和蒂芙尼一起买圣诞树\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, Mom, tomorrow night we're going with Tiffany to buy a Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好的，但是一个小的 小心你的手指\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}OK, but a small one. Watch your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能，一个大的噢！倒霉！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No way, a big one. Ow! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没事吧？ -是的，它增加了味道\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Are you OK? - Yeah, it adds flavour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-喂？ -我们不要\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Hello? - We don't want any.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅谁？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea who?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道是西娅?布罗迪 我有几个孙子？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I know it's Thea Brody. How many grandkids do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-我可以自己打电话 -我知道你是个大姑娘\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I can call by myself. - I know. You're a big girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-我现在五岁了，奶奶 -我知道你五岁了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I'm five now, Grandma. - I know you're five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.54,0:03:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨，孩子 你在下面怎么样？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hi, kiddo. How're you doin' down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好，肖恩叔叔 我在上游泳课\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm fine, Uncle Sean. I'm taking swimming lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-她游得像条鱼 -迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- She swims like a fish. - Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿，兄弟 -鱼检查一下\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Hey, bro. - The fish. Check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-不可能！你查一下 -我在打电话\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- No way! You check it. - I'm on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么了？ -你奶奶是个奴隶司机！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- What's going on?  - Your grandmother is a slave driver!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-你拿到书了吗？ -是的 谢谢\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Did you get the book? - Yeah. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,问问大医生他的工作 艰难的生活，你这个巴哈马海滩流浪汉\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ask the big doctor about his job. Tough life, you Bahamian beach bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-他听到了 -很好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- He heard that. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，你怎么能早点走？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey, how come you get to leave early?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我的桌子离门比较近\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Cos my desk is closer to the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-一个大的 -不，你弟弟不在这里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- A big one. - No, your brother won't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-圣诞快乐！ -圣诞快乐，吉姆\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Merry Christmas! - Merry Christmas, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-星期四晚上吃蛋酒！ -我们会去的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Eggnog time Thursday night! - We'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得到一棵大树 所有的旧装饰品\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We are getting a big tree for all the old ornaments...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-披风上有长统袜 -为圣诞老人准备饼干和啤酒\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- With stockings on the mantle... - And cookies and beer for Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧！蒂芙尼，你知道吗 你要嫁给一个多么疯狂的人？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All right! Tiffany, do you realise what a madman you're marrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，我知道\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-我要办理登机手续 -好的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I gotta check in. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-再见爱你 -再见我也是\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- See you. Love you. - Bye. Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-别迟到！ -是的，是的，是的，是的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Don't be late! - Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真糟糕，嗯？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的无咖啡因饮料用完了， 备用金和申请表\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're out of decaf, petty cash and requisition forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我走之前有什么事吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Anything to do before I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那个人一直在打电话 关于他的训练片\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That man keeps calling about his training film.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会相信的 我们没有特警队\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He won't believe we don't have a SWAT team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安，波利！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Good night, Polly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.91,0:05:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,友好警察局\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Amity Police Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别动！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个旧的码头堆 在频道里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There's an old dock piling in the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,也许它会继续 一直漂到它消失？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Maybe it'll just keep on drifting till it goes away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-它卡在频道标记上了 -晚安，波莉\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- It's stuck on a channel marker. - Good night, Polly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈它别动！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Uh-huh. It... Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,必须清除 在渔夫回来之前\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It has to be cleared before the fishermen come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,伦尼在哪里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Where's Lenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,去本主人家 给牛小费\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Out to Ben Master's place. Cow tipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,给牛小费？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Cow tipping?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,说孩子们给他睡觉的牛翻了个身 他们不给牛奶\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Says kids tip over his sleeping cows. They're not givin' milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好的，我会处理的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}OK, I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:06:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,布罗迪?威尔副警长 亲自处理\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Deputy Brody will take care of it personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话回家，告诉他们我要迟到了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Call home, tell 'em I'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-啊哈 -给牛小费！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Uh-huh. - Cow tipping!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 第一个诺尔 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ The first Noel ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 天使说 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ The angels did say ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 对某些可怜的牧羊人来说 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ Was to certain poor shepherds ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.85,0:06:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 他们躺在地上 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ In fields as they lay... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-不，不，不，不！别动！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- No, no, no, no! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别动！大家在一起！ 一起，记得吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hold it! Together, people! Together, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧让我们再试一次 二，三\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All right. Let's try it again. Two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,智者到底在哪里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Where the hell are the Wise Men?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运，哈利\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Good luck, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要和这帮人在一起\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm gonna need it with this bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.25,0:06:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来比 当我还是牧羊人的时候\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sounds better than when I was a shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,约瑟夫， 你的长袍到底在哪？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Joseph, where the hell is your robe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该是 穿上戏服！天哪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You're supposed to be in costume! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，快点离开 准备好了，天使，还有\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All right, clear quickly. Ready, angels, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，各位很好 现在，再一次，诺埃尔，大家\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Very good, people. Very good. And now, again, Noel, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！救命啊！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, God! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助我！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.24,0:09:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！帮助我！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, God! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.53,0:10:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他的东西 我以为你会想要的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}His things. I thought you'd want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶！奶奶！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Grandma! Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈妈？ -我们来了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Mom? - We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅，下来来吧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea, get down here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在家吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.21,0:11:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈呢？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Where's Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经在外面呆了几个小时了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}She's been out there for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么样了？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}How's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚从蒂芙尼家来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We've just come from Tiffany's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的女孩 医生不得不给她注射镇静剂\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Poor girl. The doctors had to sedate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好，塔夫特夫人 -嗨，甜心\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Hello, Mrs Taft. - Hi, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:12:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我没认出你，西娅 你已经长大了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I didn't recognise you, Thea. You're so grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩叔叔死了，你知道的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Uncle Sean is dead, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-他还会回来吗？ -我们稍后再谈\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Will he ever come back? - We'll talk about that more later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你饿了吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我吃了个汉堡包 在飞机上\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I had a hamburger on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以做得更好 来一个有趣的骨头三明治怎么样？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We can do better than that. How about a funny bone sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,飞机怎么样？ 很好我有两个棒棒糖\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}How was the aeroplane ride? Good. I got two lollipops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-它是为他而来的 -什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- It came for him. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.79,0:12:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,它一直在等待， 它为他而来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It waited all this time, and it came for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一定饿坏了 我来做点意大利烤肉\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You guys must be starving. I'll make some fettuccini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我在做晚饭 你应该坐下来放松\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm making dinner. You should sit and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真的，艾伦， 没什么可做的了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Really, Ellen, there's nothing left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你离开水里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I want you to get out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.74,0:13:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你放弃 那份糟糕的工作！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I want you to give up that terrible job!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不可能是认真的 -他妈的对\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You can't be serious. - Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚开始\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不想你靠近水 -妈妈，你很难过\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I don't want you near the water. - Mom, you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想要我的家人 再靠近水的地方\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't want my family anywhere near the water again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-从来没有！ -你不能相信那个巫毒\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Never! - You can't believe that voodoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼不会挑人杀人\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sharks don't pick people to murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,它选中了肖恩 它杀了你父亲\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It picked out Sean. It killed your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸死于心脏病发作 -他死于恐惧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Dad died from a heart attack. - He died from fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈，妈妈，妈妈，妈妈，听我说\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Mom, Mom, Mom, Mom, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.69,0:14:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没有一个伟大的白人 我们住的地方，永远\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There's never been a great white where we live, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是温水他们不喜欢\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's warm water. They don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你弟弟死了 你父亲死了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Your brother's dead. Your father's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.12,0:14:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一块木头！ 那是一块烂木头！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It was a piece of wood! It was a shitty piece of wood!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是在做他的工作\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He was just doing his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝，他能让我笑 有时候\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}God, he could make me laugh sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.89,0:14:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他总是跟在我后面 我们小时候\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He was always taggin after me when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直想这么做 我是什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He always wanted to do what I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，你要去哪里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里都没有！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一切 有一个季节，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}To everything there is a season,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.21,0:15:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一个达到所有目的的时刻 在天堂之下\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}and a time to every purpose under heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,出生的时刻 还有死亡的时间\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A time to be born and a time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,种植的时候，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A time to plant,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,一个振作起来的时刻 种植的东西\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}and a time to pluck up that which is planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一个杀戮的时刻，一个治愈的时刻\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A time to kill and a time to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,崩溃的时刻 一段时间来积累\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A time to break down and a time to build up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哭泣的时刻 是时候开怀大笑了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A time to weep and a time to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一个哀悼的时刻，一个跳舞的时刻\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A time to mourn and a time to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,抛石的时刻\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A time to cast away stones
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.41,0:15:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一次 把石头聚在一起\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}and a time to gather stones together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,拥抱的时刻\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A time to embrace
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一次 不拥抱”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}and a time to refrain from embracing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，汤姆，等等！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey, Tom, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，你会宠坏她的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, you're gonna spoil her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶就是为了这个\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That's what grandmas are for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不下来 和我们一起去岛上？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Why don't you come down to the islands with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.27,0:16:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-我我不能那么做 -来吧，妈妈\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I... I can't do that. - Come on, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-暖和点，和西娅待在一起 -是的！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Get warm, spend time with Thea... - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,过来，你\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come here, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道我的想法吗？ 我觉得这是个好主意\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Wanna know what I think? I think it's a wonderful idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的 -拜托，至少考虑一下\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Yes. - Come on, at least consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-走开你不应该一个人 -是的！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Get away. You shouldn't be alone. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-太好了！ -耶！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Great! - Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.34,0:16:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们可以赶上4点半的渡轮 -今天？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- We can catch the 4.30 ferry. - Today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-今天 -不，我不能\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Today. - No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，你可以\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.23,0:16:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-甩我，甩我！ -好吧，好吧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Swing me, swing me! - OK, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，我的背！我不能这么做\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, my back! I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我带她去 哦，天哪，她太重了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'll take her. Oh, my God, she's too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我们，爸爸\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Help us, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好的，给你坐飞机\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}OK, here we go. Aeroplane ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.24,0:17:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我要把你扔下水\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I know. I'm gonna throw you overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，看！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，嘿， 我一直想骑这种车\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, hey, I always wanted to ride one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 鸡肉\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No way. Chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.47,0:18:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈总是说如果上帝是指我们 为了好玩而乘降落伞，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Mom always said if God meant us to ride parachutes for fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.94,0:18:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们天生就有票 -我从没说过\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- we'd be born with tickets. - I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，你做到了1977年8月\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yes, you did. August 1977.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,送苏打水的女士在哪？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Where's the lady who brings the soda?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.11,0:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把它们放在大飞机上\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}They had them on the big plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,暖瓶里有一些咖啡\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There's some coffee in the Thermos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我太年轻了，不适合喝咖啡 我能开车吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm too young for coffee. Can I drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.41,0:18:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有时爸爸把我放在他腿上 让我开吉普车\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sometimes Dad puts me in his lap and lets me steer the Jeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,有时我让有趣的人 坐在我膝上驾驶飞机\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sometimes I let interesting people sit in my lap and steer the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦，真的吗？ -真的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Oh, really? - Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-霍吉？ -是吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Hoagie? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.72,0:18:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克说剩下的你得飞了 你的生活\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake says you'll have to fly the rest of your life
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,去偿还你在垃圾场失去的东西\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}to pay off what you lost at craps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息传得快 我下次再拿回来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Good news travels fast. I'll get it back next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会上下颠簸 当没有路的时候？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}How come it bumps up and down when there's no road?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是风吹的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The wind does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前去过巴哈马吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You been to the Bahamas before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.19,0:18:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-没有 -第一次是最好的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- No. - First time's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那你知道的太多了 什么都不一样\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Then you know too much and nothing's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么使飞机上下颠簸？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What makes the plane go up and down?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,容易的你这样走， 房子也变大了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Easy. You go like this, and the houses get bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就这样走， 房子变小了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Then you go like this, and the houses get smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-你想去兜风吗？ -是的！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Do you wanna go for a ride? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 所以我提议 这个简单的短语 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ And so I'm offering this simple phrase ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 一岁到92岁的孩子 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ To kids from one to 92 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 尽管有人说 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ Although it's been said ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 很多次，很多方式 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ Many times, many ways ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 圣诞快乐 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ Merry Christmas ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 对你来说 ∮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}∮ To you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,肯尼和三驾马车在比赛 在码头上快点，快点，快点！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Kenny and Tamika are playing on the dock. Hurry, hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.13,0:20:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都出去！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.55,0:20:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-来吧 -肯尼，三驾马车！我回来了！我回家了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Come on. - Kenny, Tamika! I'm back! I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你 带着袋子，罗密欧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Let me help you with the bags there, Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-你可以拿重的 -谢谢，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You can take the heavy ones. - Thanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.73,0:20:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶！奶奶！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Grandma! Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.53,0:20:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你的房间在这里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Your room's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶，看着我！奶奶！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Grandma, watch me! Grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅！从那里下去！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea! Get down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-奶奶，看着我！ -从那里下去！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Grandma, watch me! - Get down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈妈让我来 -太危险了！别那么做！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Mommy lets me. - It's too dangerous! Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-奶奶，看着我！ -来吧，甜心\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Grandma, watch me! - Come on, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但你总是让我\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}But you always let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,今天不行来吧，西娅\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Not today. Come on, Thea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的孩子都是\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The other kids are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.05,0:20:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸，为什么我不能？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Daddy, why can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.35,0:20:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到我说的话了吗？ 快到屋里来！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Did you hear what I said? Come inside the house right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不想我想荡秋千 -现在你得打开行李\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I don't want to. I wanna swing. - Right now you have to unpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:21:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是故意要开始这一切的 我觉得自己像个奶奶\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I didn't mean to start all this. I feel like such a grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧我带你到处看看\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come on. I'll show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不！不！把我放下！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No! No! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.49,0:21:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-你能不能别再闹了？ -我想荡秋千！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Will you stop making a scene? - I wanna swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.33,0:21:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我会没事的，迈克尔\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'll be all right, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,很好我也会\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Good. So will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她称之为“游手好闲”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}She calls it "Tourist on the Loose".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,当地政府委托的 去公共海滩\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The local government commissioned it for the public beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-你把商店忘了 -哦，是的是啊\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You forgot about the store. - Oh, yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要牛奶，面包\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We need milk, bread...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.27,0:21:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个盛大的揭幕仪式\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There's a big unveiling ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.69,0:21:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们需要啤酒！ -好的，我马上就到！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- We need beer! - OK, I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不错吧？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Pretty good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能别再放屁了？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Will you stop fartin around?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.65,0:23:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，他妈的 你在下面干什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, what the hell you doin' down there, eh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.95,0:23:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克，别再烦我了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake, stop bustin' my chops.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,听着，你还记得 他们长什么样？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Listen, you remember what they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.66,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,外面很硬， 在里面嚼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hard on the outside, chewy on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候他们会来 有点脏\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sometimes they come with a little grime.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.21,0:23:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，伙计！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Move your ass, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.79,0:23:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,啊，宾果！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ah, bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很好你有多少？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Good. How many you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.55,0:23:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，迈克尔，跟我谈谈 给我一些号码多少？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come on, Michael, talk to me. Give me some numbers. How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.72,0:23:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-别管我 -你满是狗屎\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Leave me alone. - You're full of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你一整天都在下面， 除了借口什么也不能说\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You been down there all day, nothin' to show but excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.89,0:23:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔， 你在说“该死的东西”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, you're taggin' the damn things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.06,0:23:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把女士们分开 首先是先生们\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I gotta separate the ladies from the gentlemen first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不，伙计，不要你走得太慢了 你有两种速度 慢和更慢\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No, man, don't. You move too slow. You got two speeds, slow and slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.07,0:23:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别动，杰克 雌性有卵\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hold your water, Jake. The females have eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.91,0:23:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们要停止一切 分发雪茄？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}So we're gonna stop everything and pass out cigars?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.33,0:24:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是为了看 他们去哪里，如何传播\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're being paid to see where they go, how they propagate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们有足够的资金，我会学习 他们的马达系统，温度\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}If we had decent funding, I'd study their motor systems, temperature...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.50,0:24:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要做一份像样的报告 给他们一些东西\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We'd do a decent report for a change and really give them something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.13,0:24:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不理我， 我就能做我的工作了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}If you'd leave me alone, I'd be able to do my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.68,0:24:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么标记海螺\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I know how to tag a damn conch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.18,0:24:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-你的阅读很糟糕，伙计 -标签很烂\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Your readings suck, man. - The tags suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.23,0:24:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-不，是我做的 -是我穿的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- No, it's I that made them. - It's I that put 'em on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.52,0:24:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-你弄错了 -不，不，不！它们漏了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You put 'em on wrong. - No, no, no! They leak!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.52,0:24:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,盲人能找到更多的海螺！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A blind man could find more conch!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.86,0:24:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你找不到你的屁股 用双手！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You can't find your ass with both hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这不公平！你走开，过来 回来一个僵尸，今天是平安夜\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That's not fair! You go away, come back a zombie, it's Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.08,0:24:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们加班是因为你！ -嘿！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- We're working overtime cos of YOU! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.34,0:24:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你弟弟很抱歉，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm sorry about your brother, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.13,0:24:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，只是 别紧张，好吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Well, just... just take it easy, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.35,0:25:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.48,0:25:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，杰克，别 我不想\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}C'mon, Jake, don't... I don't want...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.27,0:25:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦！把我放下 -我想你了，伙计！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Oh! Put me down. - I missed you, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.32,0:25:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他写了脏话 整个车库\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And then he wrote dirty words all over the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.49,0:25:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他是你爸爸五岁 他和你一样大\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He was... your daddy was five. He was your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.99,0:25:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-我快六岁了 -杰克也是\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I'm almost six. - So is Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.66,0:25:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，看看那张脸 好的，做另一个\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, look at that face. OK, do the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这更接近真实情况了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Now that's closer to the real truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.34,0:25:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，你这家伙总是 搞点恶作剧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, you. This guy was always getting into some sort of mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.51,0:25:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我对此毫不怀疑\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I got no doubt about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.60,0:25:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩叔叔曾经坏过吗？ 你打过他吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Was Uncle Sean ever bad? Did you ever spank him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.65,0:25:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,穿得很漂亮，杰克\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sharp shirt, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.44,0:25:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，祝你的性生活 像你的衬衫一样忙\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey, may your sex life be as busy as your shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.74,0:25:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么，谢谢\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.15,0:25:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我的茶具！我拿了茶具！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}My tea set! I got my tea set!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.37,0:26:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，让我看看！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.28,0:26:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,每一位可爱的女士 应该有一套茶具\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Every lovely lady should have a tea set.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.75,0:26:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,它有一个茶壶 还有杯子和碟子\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It has a teapot and cups and saucers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.75,0:26:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个糖碗 还有一个奶精\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And a sugar bowl and a creamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.84,0:26:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以放真正的茶吗？ 是的，真茶\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Can I put real tea in it? Yes, real tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.21,0:26:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做三明治吗？ 对\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Can I make sandwiches? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.51,0:26:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅，我们忘了 圣诞颂歌\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea, we forgot the Christmas carols.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.89,0:26:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,杂货店的卡罗尔？ 哦，你能阻止它吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Carol from the grocery store? Oh, will you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.90,0:26:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他，妈妈\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I miss him, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.24,0:26:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-我要你换工作 -妈妈，请不要开始\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I want you to change your work. - Mom, please don't start that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.66,0:26:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-你可以教或写 -我现在不会放弃\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You could teach or write... - I'm not gonna quit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.29,0:26:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我只剩下你了我不想 你在水里工作\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You're all I have left. I don't want you working in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.80,0:27:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈，我所做的是绝对安全的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Mom, what I do is perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.68,0:27:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,目前， 我们在收集大蜗牛\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}At the moment, we're collecting big snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.10,0:27:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克和我是科学家 我们差不多是博士了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake and I are scientists. We're almost PhDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.44,0:27:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道我们在做什么 没什么好担心的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We know what we're doing. There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.59,0:27:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，太好了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.76,0:27:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而且，好吧，我们得挖 沟很深\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And, well, we have to dig the ditch really deep...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.43,0:27:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,所以水会一直流下去 我们可以在里面游泳\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}so the water'll go all the way around and we can swim in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.64,0:27:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你真傻\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You're silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.10,0:27:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我们假装 这是白金汉宫\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You know what? Let's pretend this is Buckingham Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.07,0:27:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你将成为狄公主， 我们要和马一起游行\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And you'll be Princess Di, and we'll have a parade with horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你将乘坐金色的马车， 我们会\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And you'll ride in a golden carriage, and we'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.53,0:28:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以邀请 灰姑娘去舞会\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And I can invite Cinderella to the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.12,0:28:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她会来的 也坐在金色的马车里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}She'll come in a golden carriage, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.75,0:28:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以 饼干，潘趣酒和蛋糕\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And we can have cookies and punch and cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.71,0:28:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以邀请 查理王子和\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And I can invite Prince Charlie and...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.09,0:28:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,叫什么名字 另一个王子？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What's the name of the other prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.39,0:28:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶？奶奶？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Grandma? Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.98,0:28:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.56,0:28:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.56,0:28:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，我们最好把这事做完 在涨潮之前\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, we better get this done before the tide comes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.11,0:28:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,逃避是不好的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's not nice to be evasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.40,0:28:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈说的 一直对我父亲说\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}My mother says that to my father all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你好，你们两个！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hello, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.08,0:28:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.29,0:28:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道我为什么在这里钓鱼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't know why I fish here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.79,0:28:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也抓不到\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I never catch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.21,0:29:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,水下一定有标志“小心，霍吉在附近”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There must be a sign underwater  "beware, Hoagie's about".
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.76,0:29:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-你开飞机 -驾驶飞机\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You drive the plane. - Flies the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.76,0:29:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上，就像开车一样\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Mostly, it's like driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.93,0:29:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么，一个挖掘？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What's that, an excavation?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.97,0:29:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在建一座沙堡， 我们邀请你喝茶\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're building a sand castle, and you're invited for tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.31,0:29:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你为什么 没有野心？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You know why you got no ambition?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.23,0:29:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-为什么，杰克？ -你的诺曼罗克韦尔生活\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Why is that, Jake? - Your Norman Rockwell life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.24,0:29:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,诺曼?罗克韦尔？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Norman Rockwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.78,0:29:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那正是 你的问题，我的朋友\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That's precisely your problem, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.57,0:29:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是一个被剥夺了权利的孩子\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You weren't exactly a deprived kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.20,0:29:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信 根摇滚雷鬼胡说\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't buy that roots-rock-reggae bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.75,0:29:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,剪头发， 你是一套三件套的西装\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Cut that hair, you're a three-piece suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.92,0:29:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,底线是我们有三个 剩下几个月的工作没有钱了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The bottom line is we got three months left of work and no money.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.09,0:29:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都花在啤酒上了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Spent it all on beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.55,0:29:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,巴哈马渔业部 不完全是诺克斯堡，我的朋友\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Bahamian Fisheries Department is not exactly Fort Knox, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.22,0:29:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但另一方面，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}But, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.14,0:29:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,海军研究办公室， 他们有钱\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Office of Naval Research, they've got money.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.89,0:29:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不，算了吧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.93,0:29:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思？钱就是钱\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What do you mean? Money is money.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.19,0:30:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们把炸弹放在海豚身上 -你在说什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- They put bombs on dolphins. - What you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.11,0:30:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识一个有钱的人 去研究鳗鱼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I know a guy who got money from them to study eels.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.11,0:30:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,很难放炸弹 在鳗鱼上！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's hard to put a bomb on an eel!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.86,0:30:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,谁弄坏了你的笼子？迈克尔，伙计！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Who rattled your cage? Michael, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.32,0:30:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在破坏我们的小木屋 为了拿到学位\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're bustin' our bunghies to get our degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.87,0:30:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经厌倦了天堂的一切\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm tired of all this paradise shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.33,0:30:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我很紧张，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's getting on my last nerve, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.67,0:30:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉看看你，孩子\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}William. Look at you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.00,0:30:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么？ -整天看书的精神侏儒\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- What? - A mental midget reading all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.71,0:30:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果平庸使人发胖， 你们都是鲸鱼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}If mediocrity were fattening, you'd all be whales.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.42,0:30:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别再敲了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Knock off that drummin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.05,0:30:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你，孩子 你怎么了？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Look at you, boy. What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.76,0:30:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为因为你去过 大学你聪明吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You think because you been to university you're smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.14,0:30:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 为什么我要告诉你这些\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't know why I've told you all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.86,0:30:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有时会说话 对陌生人来说更容易\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sometimes talking to a stranger is easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.32,0:30:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法解释 这只是我的感觉\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I can't explain it. It's just something I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.99,0:30:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是倾听自己的感受\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I always listen to my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.04,0:30:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我快疯了 噩梦和\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I think I'm going crazy. Nightmares and...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:31:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是意外\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Maybe it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.79,0:31:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是意外\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It was no accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.67,0:31:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说你错了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm not saying you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.63,0:31:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说也许 还有其他的可能性\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm just saying that maybe there are other possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.47,0:31:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,当它杀死肖恩的时候，我知道 毫无疑问，这是为他而来的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}When it killed Sean, I knew with certainty it had come for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.39,0:31:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I knew that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.31,0:31:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道它来了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I know it's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.73,0:31:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道它来了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I know it's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.02,0:31:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,坐那架飞机要多少钱？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What's it cost to ride on that plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.57,0:31:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,水进来了！ 水进来了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The water's coming in! The water's coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.86,0:31:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,取决于你想去哪里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Depends on where you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.86,0:31:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-没关系 -快点！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Doesn't matter. - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.45,0:31:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-就这样？ -就这样\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Just like that? - Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.83,0:31:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！哦，不！哦！哦！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh! Oh, no! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.08,0:31:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,开车！ 我很抱歉？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Take the wheel! I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.21,0:31:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-开车 -不，我不能\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Take the wheel. - No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.42,0:31:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-当然可以 -我不知道怎么做\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Sure, you can. - I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.88,0:31:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人知道\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Nobody does till they learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.26,0:31:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.81,0:32:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,最好开车 否则我们很快就要游泳了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Better take the wheel or we'll be swimming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.02,0:32:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，别紧张！ 别紧张！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Whoa, take it easy! Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.94,0:32:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,轻轻地抱着她 她会自己飞的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hold her gently. She'll damn near fly herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.87,0:32:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吗？就像开车一样\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}See? Just like driving a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.91,0:32:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我在哪下车？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Where do I pull off the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.95,0:32:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不，你做得很好 我不让你惹麻烦\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No, you're doing fine. I'll keep you out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.08,0:32:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-放松点 -我们要去哪里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Relax. - Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.09,0:32:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有一次，我在运送补给 亚马逊河上游\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}One time, I was flying supplies up the Amazon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.17,0:32:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,当我在丛林里下来的时候\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}when I came down in the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.30,0:32:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不告诉我？ -我被猎头抓住了，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You won't tell me? - I was picked up by head-hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.30,0:32:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,带去见他们的头儿\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}and taken to their chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.93,0:32:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不可能！ -他看着我\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You are impossible! - He looked at me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.43,0:32:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,把我带进他的小屋\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}and took me in his hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.47,0:32:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在他的小屋里， 有一根很长的杆子\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Inside his hut, there was a long pole...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.03,0:32:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.83,0:33:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一点小东西 我安排让你高兴起来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Just a little something I arranged to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.50,0:33:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-不，真的 -什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- No, really. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.08,0:33:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-告诉我，这是什么？ -当地的节日\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Tell me, what is all this? - A local festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.34,0:33:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,它被称为junkanoo\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's called a junkanoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.76,0:33:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我没听到 上面什么都行，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm not hearing anything up here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.47,0:33:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底标记了多少个？ 多少？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}How many have you tagged, exactly? How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.43,0:33:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔别再破坏我的小木屋了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael... stop busting my bunghie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.85,0:33:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，你没关系， 但不是为了我，嗯？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yeah, it's OK for you, but not for me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.52,0:33:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕，杰克来了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Have no fear, Jake is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.94,0:33:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚撞到了母亲的矿脉 我在数\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I just struck the mother lode. I'm counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.99,0:33:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点 那套漂亮的设备，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Watch yourself with that fancy equipment, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.07,0:33:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的电线会 把你的头发竖起来很有趣\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Such a live wire'll make your hair stick up funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.24,0:33:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，迈克尔威廉？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That's good, Michael. William?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.49,0:33:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，那个男孩没有希望了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yeah, there's no hope for that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.87,0:33:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 杰克，那是个笑话\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake? Jake, that's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.09,0:33:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.43,0:33:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这儿有条大鱼，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We got a big fish down here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.80,0:34:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，是吗？有多大？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, yeah? How big?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.81,0:34:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-天哪！ -当心！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Jesus! - Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.02,0:34:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.32,0:34:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,艾伦？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.16,0:34:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.50,0:34:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-艾伦，怎么了？ -什么都没有没有什么我很好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Ellen, what's wrong? - Nothing. Nothing. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.71,0:34:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-不，你不是 -我很棒\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- No, you're not. - I'm terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.97,0:34:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.64,0:34:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃吧！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.11,0:34:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能一直这样\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You can't keep doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.32,0:34:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不能一直这样 -你答应我喝一杯\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I can't keep doing THIS. - You promised me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.61,0:35:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼来来往往，艾伦 人们与此无关\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sharks come and go, Ellen. People have nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.20,0:35:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-带伞的饮料 -艾伦，放弃吧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- A drink with an umbrella in it. - Ellen, give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.37,0:35:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,踢它屁股\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Give it a kick in the arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.54,0:35:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,继续你的生活\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Get on with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.51,0:35:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你经历了什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I know what you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.64,0:35:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 噩梦会消失的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Don't worry. The nightmares'll go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.81,0:35:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,把眼镜给我，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Give me my glasses, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.73,0:35:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,小子，我从没见过 没什么大不了的从未！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Boy, I ain't never seen nothin' so big. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.40,0:35:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我就在迈克尔旁边 那东西正好从我身边经过！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I was right next to Michael. The thing went right past me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.07,0:35:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,应该为你而去的，杰克 为什么会这样？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Should've gone for you, Jake. Why did it come up?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.03,0:35:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-它在温水里干什么？ -有什么区别？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- What's it doing in warm water? - What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.54,0:35:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,它只是一条鲨鱼 一条又大又漂亮的鲨鱼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's only a shark. A big, big, beautiful shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.58,0:35:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的 不要对任何人说任何话\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And it's ours. Don't say anything to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.54,0:35:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,渔夫会试图杀死它 迈克尔，我们有一个很棒的白人\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Fishermen would try to kill it. Michael, we got us a great white.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.88,0:36:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们要做一些真正的研究\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Now we gonna do some real research.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.18,0:36:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我个忙，别说 跟我妈说什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Do me a favour, don't say anything about this to my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.26,0:36:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，伙计，我不是故意的， 你知道，张开我的嘴唇，嗯？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey, man, I didn't mean to, you know, flap my lips, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.17,0:36:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 所以呢？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}So... So?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.34,0:36:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我对他说:“消毒剂呢？”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I said to him, "Where's the disinfectant?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.55,0:36:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,他说，“我把它留在城里了”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He said, "I've left it in town."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.85,0:36:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我说， “我们该怎么办？”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}So I said, "What are we gonna do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.72,0:36:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他说， “我来告诉你我们要做什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}So he says, "I'll tell you what we'll do."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.19,0:36:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,“午饭时回来，所有的 苍蝇会在厨房里”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}"Come back at lunchtime, all the flies will be in the kitchen."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.03,0:37:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,上床睡觉吧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.99,0:37:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他带她去观光\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He took her sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.12,0:37:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，你工作我工作\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Well, you work. I work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.74,0:37:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要有人帮助她 把她的注意力从事情上移开\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}She needs someone to help her take her mind off things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.89,0:37:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我会帮你记下 走开，水手\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'll help you take YOUR mind off things, sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.49,0:37:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,都湿透了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's soaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.86,0:37:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.00,0:37:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.46,0:38:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.15,0:38:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,路易莎\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Louisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.53,0:38:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的，杰克 我去检查一下桌子\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's OK, Jake. I'll check on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.32,0:38:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吧，一切顺利 -哦，是霍吉！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- OK, everything rides. -Ooh, it's Hoagie!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.29,0:38:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，来吧，我想看看这个\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey, come on, I wanna see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.58,0:38:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，那是霍吉，好吧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, that's Hoagie, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.29,0:38:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都在进行中\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Everything on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.96,0:38:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不是全赌了？ -要么全部要么什么都没有\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You're not betting it all? - All or nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.18,0:38:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-给，你想为我扔吗？ -不！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Here, do you want to throw for me? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.22,0:38:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,现在准备好了你准备好了吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Now get ready. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.99,0:39:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-我想那很糟糕吧？ -取决于你的观点\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I guess that's bad? - Depends on your point of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.32,0:39:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，看看那个过来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ooh, look at that. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.49,0:39:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，看看你你看起来太好了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ooh, look at you. You look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.83,0:39:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在房子里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.37,0:39:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道有原因 我买得起这个\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I knew there was a reason I could afford this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.13,0:39:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，雪莉！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thank you, Shirley!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.59,0:39:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲常说，“杰克， 你的生活中有两种爱...\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}My father used to say, "Jake, you got two loves in your life...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.09,0:39:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,“你做什么，和谁在一起”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}"what you do and who you're with."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.18,0:39:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-生日快乐，路易莎 -生日快乐！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Happy birthday, Louisa. - Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.93,0:39:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-新年快乐 -新年快乐！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- And a Happy New Year. - Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.19,0:39:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-新年快乐 -新年快乐\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Happy New Year. - Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.19,0:39:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,膝盖不要虚弱 今晚我请客，孩子\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Don't go weak in the knees on me tonight, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.82,0:39:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要 你所有的力量\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You're gonna need all the strength you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.61,0:39:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识一个单臂钢琴手，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I knew a one-armed piano player,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.82,0:39:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,花了两分钟 跳一分钟华尔兹\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}took two minutes to play the Minute Waltz.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.99,0:39:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,注意你说话的方式 迈克尔和我即将成名\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Watch how you talk. Michael and I are about to be famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.75,0:40:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-告诉他们 -杰克！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Tell 'em. - Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.12,0:40:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不谈工作你答应过的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No job talk. You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.42,0:40:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.71,0:40:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,正确的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.00,0:40:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意冒险吗 跟我跳支舞，女士？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Would you risk a dance with me, madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.55,0:40:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-你会后悔的 -你也会的我有两只右脚\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You'll be sorry. - So will you. I have two right feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.18,0:40:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，我还有两个\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That's good, I have two left.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.56,0:40:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，那是一套\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Well, that's a set.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.99,0:40:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚有点安静\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A little quiet tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.61,0:40:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-新年忧郁？ -不，一点也不\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- New Year's blues? - No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.20,0:40:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧这是我的派对\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come on. It's my party.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.45,0:40:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是迈克尔，他开始 在他睡梦中数数那些该死的海螺\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He's just Michael, he's startin' to count them damn conch in his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.54,0:40:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅我\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.14,0:40:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-介意我插手吗？ -拜托\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Mind if I cut in? - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.52,0:41:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,世界会更美好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The world would be a better place
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.81,0:41:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果更多的儿子跳舞 和他们的母亲\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}if more sons danced with their mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.53,0:41:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，别撅嘴了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, stop pouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.15,0:41:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来像你以前那样 六个却没有得到你想要的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You look like you did when you were six and didn't get what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.12,0:41:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他我喜欢和他在一起\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I like him. I enjoy his company.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.20,0:41:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊我不喜欢他 到处追你\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yeah. I don't like him chasing around after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.54,0:41:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我不信任他\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.96,0:41:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是在追 你太可笑了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He's not chasing. You are being ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.59,0:41:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直很讨厌 我很抱歉\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I've been a pain in the ass and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.55,0:41:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会打扰你的 关于你的工作\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm not gonna bother you about your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.30,0:41:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不是痛苦 -让我说完\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You're not a pain. - Let me finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.89,0:41:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经排练了一整天了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I've been rehearsing this all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.56,0:41:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩的死差点杀了我 我永远也忘不了，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sean's death almost killed me. I'll never get over it,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.23,0:41:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但我拒绝让自己 被一种痴迷所驱使\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}but I refuse to let myself be run by an obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.57,0:41:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能一直相信 这是故意的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I can't keep on believing it was intentional.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.86,0:41:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于明白了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I finally figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.11,0:41:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.20,0:41:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样，“好”？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That's it, "good"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.95,0:42:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你会爆发 香槟\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I thought you'd break out the champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.95,0:42:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我很高兴\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No, I'm pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.41,0:42:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧给你妈妈看看 你跳得真好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come on. Show your mother what a good dancer you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.22,0:42:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都在哪里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.60,0:42:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在下面！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.19,0:42:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-克拉伦斯和威廉在哪里？ -我给他们放了一天假\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Where is Clarence and William? - I gave them the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.90,0:42:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,为何？我们还有工作要完成\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What for? We got a job to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.07,0:42:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要做发射机？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Why are you making a transmitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.53,0:42:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是总计划的一部分\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's all part of the master plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.87,0:42:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在要测试一下\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're gonna test it out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.20,0:42:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要了解 它的运动系统，心率\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're gonna learn about its motor systems, its heart rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.21,0:42:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要学习 壮丽的动物\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're going to study a magnificent animal
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.05,0:42:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道那么多\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}no one knows that much about.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.76,0:43:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳下山时，我们出价 向海螺家族告别\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}As the sun sets, we bid a fond farewell to the family of conch.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.14,0:43:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我勒个去 你在说什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.76,0:43:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把它包起来交上来 为什么你的心比我的强？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We wrap it up and hand it in. Why is your heart stronger than mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.39,0:43:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们什么都没写 直到我们结束\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We don't write up anything till we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.65,0:43:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我小时候，我父亲说，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}When I was a boy, my father said,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.86,0:43:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,“今天什么都不要做 你可以推迟到明天”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}"Never do anything today you can put off till tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.53,0:43:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们海螺明天会在那里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Them conch gonna be there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.86,0:43:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-当我们拿到补助金的时候，上面说 -不，当我拿到补助金的时候\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- When we got the grant, it said... - No, when I got the grant.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.37,0:43:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吧，当我登录时，我 -当我邀请你的时候\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- OK, when I signed on, I... - When I invited you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.54,0:43:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们一起拿到了补助金 -当我们在一起的时候\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- We got the grant together. - When we got it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.75,0:43:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有三个月的工作要做 关于这个我们不能写报告\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We got three months' work left on this. We can't write a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.54,0:43:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，我们这儿有只稀有的鸟 你知道吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, we got a rare bird here. You know that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.01,0:43:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的白人不会下来 去巴哈马，永远不要\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Great white don't come down to the Bahamas, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.68,0:43:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有机会吗 就这么游走？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Do we let an opportunity just swim away?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.10,0:43:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字在报告上\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}My name's on the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.02,0:43:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,半途而废的工作，我找不到 我的博士学位，你也一样\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}A half-assed job, I don't get my doctorate and neither do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.56,0:43:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我们在计划 一起拥有美好的未来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I thought we were planning a rosy future together.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.02,0:43:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.94,0:44:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.16,0:44:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.28,0:44:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在家吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Anybody home in there at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.87,0:44:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好脚踏实地 和我们其他人一起\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You better beam down to Earth with the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.25,0:44:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那条鲨鱼还在水里， 它不会永远在那里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}If that shark's still in the water, it won't be there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.54,0:44:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,会有结果的 水太热了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's gonna figure out the water's too warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.71,0:44:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我告诉我你不想 像我一样研究那条鱼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Look at me and tell me you don't want to study that fish as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.51,0:44:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔？嗯？ 这就是我们训练的目的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael? Huh? This is what we trained for.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.89,0:44:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们研究的 那些该死的书\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}This is what we studied them damn books for.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.18,0:44:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,记得， 我的名字也写在那份报告上\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Remember, my name goes on that report, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.19,0:44:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说同样重要 就像对你一样，对吧？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's as important to me as it is to you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.36,0:44:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧， 你喜欢这些该死的蜗牛吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All right, you like them damn snails?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.24,0:44:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，好吧， 我给你做个交易听\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All right, all right, I'll make you a deal. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.66,0:44:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们研究那条鲨鱼， 就几天，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We study that shark, just for a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.70,0:44:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,又回来了 敬你可爱的蜗牛\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}and it's back to your lovely snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.33,0:44:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这很公平，伙计这很公平\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Now that's fair, man. That's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.41,0:44:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，让我尽情享受吧，嗯？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come on, indulge me with it, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.55,0:45:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我对电子技术一窍不通\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't know shit about electronics.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.17,0:45:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子，你什么都不知道 任何事\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Boy, you don't know shit about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.72,0:45:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你该学会了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's time you learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.01,0:45:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我来教你怎么戴头发， 如何跳舞\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'll teach you how to wear your hair, how to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.14,0:45:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如何装箱来吧，跟我来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}How to box. Come on, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.56,0:45:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的屁股放下来，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Get your butt down here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.44,0:45:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是第三次了 你忘了拿出来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}This is the third time you've forgotten to take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.53,0:45:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-我有很多想法 -你不记得他们什么时候来了吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I got a lot on my mind. - You can't remember when they come?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.20,0:45:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的大脑在萎缩\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}My brain is shrinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.12,0:45:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别给我那个 全神贯注的科学家废话\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Don't give me that preoccupied scientist crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.37,0:45:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在准备 为了一个大事件！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm getting ready for a big event!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.79,0:45:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为艺术家们在工作 和他们的潜意识\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I thought artists worked with their subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.04,0:45:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这是我的责任？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}How come it's my responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.63,0:45:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Because.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.34,0:45:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哦好吧，现在我明白了 你只要解释一下就行了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh. OK, now I understand. All you had to do was explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.31,0:45:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒垃圾因为\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I take out the garbage... because.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.77,0:45:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴我们 弄清楚了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm glad we got that straightened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.31,0:46:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们什么都没有 理顺了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We don't have anything straightened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.91,0:46:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你有点紧张\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You're uptight about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.95,0:46:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.87,0:46:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会出什么事？ 我今天休假很愉快，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Why should there be anything wrong? I'm enjoying my day off,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.71,0:46:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我妻子开始对我大喊大叫 关于垃圾的事\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}my wife starts yelling at me about the garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.47,0:46:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在争论什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What are we arguing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.14,0:46:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道一、\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't know. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.14,0:46:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.23,0:46:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.98,0:46:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-不公平，我没有武器 -那就别再靠近了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- No fair, I'm not armed. - Then don't come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.95,0:46:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-关掉它关了 -不，我有工作\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Turn it off. Off. - No. I have work.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.91,0:46:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想做爱 一个愤怒的焊工\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I've always wanted to make love to an angry welder.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.96,0:47:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没想到 因为我还是个小男孩\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I've dreamed of nothing else since I was a small boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.64,0:47:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-把门关上 -啊哈稍后\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Shut the door. - Uh-huh. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.77,0:47:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-嗯！嗯！ -迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Mmm! Mmm! - Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.61,0:47:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,把门关上！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Shut the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.20,0:47:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定你 以前做过吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You sure you've done this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.12,0:47:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，是的很多次 相信你的杰克叔叔，嗯？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, yeah. Lots of times. Trust your Uncle Jake, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.38,0:47:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都很管用，嗯？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's always worked, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.88,0:47:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，呃到目前为止\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Well, uh... thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.01,0:47:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，带我出去\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}OK, take me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.85,0:48:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再多一点\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.00,0:48:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那儿！快来！它来了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There it is! Comin'! It's comin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.01,0:48:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-你记得怎么拉绳子吗？ -是的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You remember how to pull rope, eh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.68,0:49:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对！你抓住他了，伙计！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yes! You got him, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.27,0:49:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！现在是个好时机！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ah! Now would be a good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.48,0:49:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了吗，伙计？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Did you see that, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.94,0:49:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们试着跟着它走\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Let's try to follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.94,0:49:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们要看看杰克叔叔 设备真的对我们有用\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Now we're gonna see if Uncle Jake's equipment's really working for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.66,0:49:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.59,0:49:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们的小岛同意你的意见 -我有自己的小岛\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Our little island agrees with you. - I have my own little island.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.51,0:49:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是冬天太冷了 我试过一次冬天\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}But it's so cold in the winter. I tried winter once.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.43,0:50:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了佛蒙特州伯灵顿\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Here we are. Burlington, Vermont.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.81,0:50:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我飞到纽约去了哦！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I flew a run to New York. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.98,0:50:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我左脚有一根骨头 还没有解冻\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I have a bone in my left foot that hasn't thawed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.77,0:50:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-当我还是个小男孩的时候 -顺便说一下，不难想象\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- When I was a small boy... - Not hard to imagine, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.78,0:50:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,……我梦想永远温暖\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}...I dreamed of always being warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.57,0:50:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要什么？ 不管我们上次有什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What do you want? Whatever we had last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.53,0:50:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我两个巴哈马妈妈\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Two Bahama Mamas, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.24,0:50:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-留下来我要请假 -你总是请假\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Stay. I'll take time off. - You always take time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.91,0:50:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢旅行 我会再给飞机划一个缺口\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I like to travel. I'll nick the plane again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.71,0:50:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不会惹麻烦吧？ -如果他不知道就不行\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Won't you get in trouble? - Not if he doesn't find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.46,0:50:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只是跳到 加勒比我们将花几天时间\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's just a hop down to the Caribbean. We'll spend a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.05,0:50:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一定有很多女士 谁愿意去\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There must be a lot of ladies who'd be glad to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.14,0:50:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，有，但是\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yeah, there are, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.14,0:50:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经累了 单向对话\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I've grown tired of one-way conversations.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.69,0:50:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一种无法抗拒的 渴望吻你，艾伦?布罗迪\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I have an irresistible urge to kiss you, Ellen Brody.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.98,0:50:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.32,0:50:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它不会 想想为什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Because it would not occur to you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.87,0:51:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,脸红适合你\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Blushing suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.66,0:51:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-上帝对不起 -没什么好遗憾的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Lord... I'm sorry. - It's nothing to be sorry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.83,0:51:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不，整件事 整个想法是荒谬的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No, this whole thing... The whole idea is preposterous.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.21,0:51:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.71,0:51:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-你确定你不需要眼镜吗？ -我是飞行员\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You sure you don't need glasses? - I'm a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.05,0:51:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我的视力很好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}My vision is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.64,0:51:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得到了什么？ 九节\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What are we getting? Nine knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.35,0:51:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,倒霉！我们应该跟上\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Shit! We should be keeping up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.69,0:51:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-你确定油门开着吗？ -敞开着\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You sure the throttle's open? - Wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.32,0:51:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧，你这个长得太大的金鱼！ 来找杰克叔叔\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come on, you overgrown goldfish! Come to Uncle Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.16,0:51:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-你认识霍吉多久了？ -什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- How long have you known Hoagie? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.08,0:51:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识霍吉多久了？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}How long have you known Hoagie?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.91,0:51:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-他跟这事有什么关系？ -多长时间？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- What's he got to do with it? - How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.41,0:51:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,自从他来这里 把它带到右舷！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Since he got here. Bring it to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.84,0:51:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他什么时候来的？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}When did he get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.26,0:51:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁？ -霍吉！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Who? - Hoagie!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.34,0:52:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪！ 有一天他就在这里，仅此而已\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Christ! One day he was just here, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.97,0:52:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你对他了解多少？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What do you know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.27,0:52:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他在追我妈妈\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He's after my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.81,0:52:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-有什么好笑的？ -他对她不够好，是吧？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- What's so funny? - He's not good enough for her, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.19,0:52:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意我会马上送她回家\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I agree. I'd send her home right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.07,0:52:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,带她过来， 我们走错了路\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Bring her about, we're going the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.49,0:52:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说，有些飞行员 把毒品飞到这里来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I mean, some of these pilots are flying drugs down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.16,0:52:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-他总是去某个地方 -快带她过来！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- He's always going off somewhere. - Bring her about, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.79,0:00:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.83,0:52:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-我是！ -快点，伙计，我们又失去他了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I am! - Hurry, man, we're losin' him!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.79,0:52:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-你一定知道些什么 -天哪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You must know something. - Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.25,0:52:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他喜欢赌博， 他喜欢女人，别烦我！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He likes gambling, he likes women, don't bother me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.71,0:52:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-他坐包机 -该死的！我们失去了他！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- He flies charter... - Damn! We lost him!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.30,0:52:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你的装备坏了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Maybe your gear crapped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.34,0:52:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你被淘汰了， 炫耀你的嘴唇关于霍吉\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Maybe you crapped out, flappin' your lips about Hoagie.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.69,0:52:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他已经走了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Maybe he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.99,0:53:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，菲什先生\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All right, Mr Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.87,0:53:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会回来找你的 明天\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We'll come back and find you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.96,0:53:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他所做的就是吻我！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All he did was kiss me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.17,0:53:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-好吧，那是个开始 -什么的开始？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Well, that's a beginning. - A beginning of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.13,0:53:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不管接下来发生什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}To whatever happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.76,0:53:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.72,0:53:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前以为我能应付这些 一旦我长大了，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I used to think I could handle these situations once I was grown up,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.94,0:53:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但我甚至不知道 如果他是认真的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}but I don't even know if he's serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.52,0:53:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯，给点时间，艾伦 看看会发生什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Mmm, give it some time, Ellen. See what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.19,0:53:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我的一部分人想 跟他走吧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Well, part of me wanted to go off with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.82,0:53:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.62,0:53:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他为什么要我\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't know why he wants me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.04,0:53:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他很有品味\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Maybe he's got good taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.79,0:53:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没有 和你这样的女人在一起太久了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He hasn't spent much time with a woman like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.87,0:53:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他怎么想 或者我的想法这太傻了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I don't know what he thinks. Or what I think. This is so silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.21,0:54:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己太老了，不适合做这件事\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I feel too old to be in this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.76,0:54:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望不会我指望着 长久快乐的性生活\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I hope not. I am counting on a long, happy sex life.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.68,0:54:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你说这不礼貌 打断别人\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You said it wasn't polite to interrupt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.23,0:54:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，我知道\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.90,0:54:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-奶奶，该喝茶了 -哦，我差点忘了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- It's time for tea, Grandma. - Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.52,0:54:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有 我把所有东西都放在房间里了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I didn't. I put everything in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.19,0:54:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我的泰迪熊和我们一起\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}My teddy bear's joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.83,0:54:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.67,0:54:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，怎么了？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.38,0:54:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么，只是个愚蠢的梦\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Nothing, just a stupid dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.01,0:54:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,隐马尔可夫模型\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.68,0:56:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,该睡觉了，花生\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Time for bed, peanut.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.43,0:57:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦，不！ -是的爸爸有作业\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Oh, no! - Yep. Daddy's got homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.18,0:57:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-但你昨晚让我去了 -是的，是的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- But you let me last night. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.73,0:57:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈在等着看故事\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Mommy's waiting to read a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.36,0:57:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-晚安，亲爱的！ -晚安\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Good night, sweetheart! - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.24,0:57:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安让我们站起来 吹起微风，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Night. Let's put up our feet and shoot the breeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.53,0:57:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,或者不管喝啤酒的人做什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}or whatever it is beer drinkers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.99,0:57:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一、呃，我得把 一起做这个报告，妈\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I, uh, I got to put together this report, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.91,0:57:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克说今天不要 你明天能推迟的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake says don't do today what you can put off tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.37,0:57:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，杰克有很多\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yeah, Jake's got a lot of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.04,0:57:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我过几天就要走了 我不想和你一起不开心\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm leaving in a few days. I don't want to go with you unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.17,0:57:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有不高兴\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm not unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.59,0:57:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见你和西娅了 你看起来就像你父亲\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I saw you and Thea. You looked just like your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.80,0:57:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得什么时候 你们以前常模仿他？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Do you remember when you guys used to imitate him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.30,0:57:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈，我得把这件事做完，好吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Mom, I gotta get this finished, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.77,0:57:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-我担心你 -没什么好担心的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I worry about you. - There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.56,0:57:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你妈妈这是我的工作\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm your mother. It's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.56,0:57:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只是因为你是个男人 并不意味着我已经退休了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Just cos you're a man doesn't mean I've retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.32,0:57:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我努力使自己微笑 它是轮到你了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I've worked on MY smile. It's... it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.20,0:57:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这样更好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.12,0:58:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,虚张声势，虚张声势！虚张声势，虚张声势！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Blump, blump! Blump, blump!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.04,0:58:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-虚张声势，虚张声势！虚张声势，虚张声势！ -杰克，住手！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Blump, blump! Blump, blump!  - Jake, knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.37,0:58:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,虚张声势，虚张声势好啊， 别想违背我们的协议\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Blump, blump. OK, just don't try to renege on our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.13,0:58:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,吃了半天蜗牛， 然后在鲨鱼身上呆半天\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Half a day on the snails, then a half a day on the shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.72,0:58:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有17分钟，然后我们 去找那条鲨鱼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You got 17 more minutes, then we're gonna go look for that shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.39,0:58:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,它是一个大海洋我们可以 用我们的余生去寻找\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's a big ocean. We could spend the rest of our lives looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.10,0:58:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找到他的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.85,0:58:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我有六个 我会给他们贴上标签然后马上起来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I got about a half a dozen. I'll tag 'em and be right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.52,0:58:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你，呃，听到什么了吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You, uh, hearin' anything? 
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.61,0:58:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有再酷一点， 巴哈马的一天是平静而漫长的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Nothin' at all. Just another cool, calm, tickly day in the Bahamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.15,0:58:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就待在四分之一英里内 我有三英里的监控半径\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Just stay within a quarter mile. I got a three-mile monitor radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.28,0:58:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,三英里之内，那里有很多 是时候把你那丑陋的屁股照上去了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Within three miles, there's plenty of time to beam your ugly ass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.38,0:58:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，我抓住他了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.76,0:59:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他向你走来 你最好现在就出去\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He's comin' towards you. You better get out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.30,0:59:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，我来了，我来了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All right, I'm comin', I'm comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.33,0:59:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,倒霉！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.17,0:59:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.22,0:59:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.68,0:59:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔！迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael! Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.89,0:59:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael! 
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.61,0:59:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，怎么了？ 迈克尔，你能听见我说话吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, what's goin' on? Michael, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.86,1:00:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔！迈克尔，你能听见我说话吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael! Michael, can you hear me? 
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.60,1:00:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.30,1:01:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的！哦，该死！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Son of a bitch! Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.22,1:01:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.23,1:01:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.98,1:02:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,休斯敦大学！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Uh!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.70,1:02:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.87,1:02:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,倒霉！把棒子拿过来， 我们继续下去\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Shit! Get the bang sticks, we're goin' down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.37,1:02:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们不好 -再来一个！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- They're no good. - Get another one!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.74,1:02:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，快点！迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come on, come on! Michael!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.57,1:02:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-把他扶起来！小心他的手臂！ -把他轻轻地放下！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Get him up! Watch his arm! - Lay him down gently!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.87,1:02:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要止血带 为了止血\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We need a tourniquet to stop his bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.46,1:02:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-试试这个！ -把湿衣服脱了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Try this! - Get the wet suit off.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.21,1:03:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点，不要担心\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Keep cool, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.59,1:03:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，你好吗？ 我想他可能很震惊\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, how are you? I think he may be in shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.59,1:03:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉伦斯，快走！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Clarence, move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.75,1:03:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，嘿！ 嘿，你在做什么，伙计？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey, hey, hey! Hey, what you doin', man?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.67,1:03:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,没人下水 直到我们知道那条鱼在哪里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No one goes in the water till we know where that fish is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.47,1:03:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你从马上摔下来， 你马上回来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You fall off the horse, you get right back on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.30,1:03:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼，什么废话 你在说什么？嗯？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hell, what kind of bullcrap you talkin'? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.60,1:03:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-任何人都在水里，是我 -杰克，我要下去了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Anybody's in the water, it's me. - Jake, I'm gonna go down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.98,1:04:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，那么卡拉的演唱会呢？ 快到时间了，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All right, so what about Carla's gig? It's almost time, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.65,1:04:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，我不能让你 回去吧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, I can't just let you go back down.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.16,1:04:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我吓得屁滚尿流\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm scared shitless.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.99,1:04:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底在做什么 如果我不能回到水里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What the hell do I do if I can't go back in that water?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.50,1:04:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，小心点\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}All right, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.27,1:04:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉伦斯，上那个小屋 让我们注意一下\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Clarence, get up on that shack. Give us some lookout.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.02,1:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-我希望他知道他在做什么 -他要做什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I hope he knows what he's doing. - He's doin' what he's got to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.08,1:05:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克，你是不是有关于鲨鱼的消息吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake, are you gettin' anything on the shark?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.76,1:05:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不，一切都很酷\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No, everything's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.30,1:05:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想昨天的事 可能是个错误\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm thinkin' about yesterday. It's probably a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.84,1:05:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-他饿了你看起来很好吃 -但为什么只有我？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- He was hungry. You look tasty. - But how come only me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.77,1:05:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-也许他只是喜欢吃白肉 -你是个有趣的人，杰克\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Maybe he just like white meat. - You're a funny guy, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.11,1:05:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.54,1:05:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是关于艺术的 我今天想说的话\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It is about art that I wish to speak today.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.04,1:05:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,艺术的原材料 围绕着我们，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The raw material of art surrounds us all,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.80,1:05:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在网中捕捉每一个 我们每个人\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}catching in the net that each and every one of us casts
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.18,1:05:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,融入生活的潮流\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}into the current of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.06,1:06:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-但这需要艺术 -他们到底在哪里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- But it takes the art... - Where the hell are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.60,1:06:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会来的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}They'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.44,1:06:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-我可以坐香蕉船去吗？ -嘘！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Can I go on the banana boat? - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.73,1:06:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,玛格丽特要走了 她和她妈妈在一起\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Margaret's going. She's with her mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.11,1:06:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-好的 -哦，孩子！哦，孩子！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- OK. - Oh, boy! Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.57,1:06:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-西娅，你要小心 -我会的，我会的！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Thea, you be careful. - I will, I will!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.45,1:06:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-西娅！ -没关系香蕉船很有趣\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Thea! - It's OK. Banana boats are fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.74,1:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，我们应该很幸运 我真希望我们和她一起玩\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, we should be so lucky. I wish we were out with her playin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.08,1:06:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,玛格丽特，等我！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Margaret, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.46,1:06:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,“说到重点，伙计 就像我妻子现在说的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}"Get to the point, man," as my wife now says.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.09,1:06:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊总之，艺术就是油脂 为了生命之轮\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}OK. Well, in short, art is grease for the wheel of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.01,1:06:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我们很荣幸 奉献一件艺术品\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Today we are privileged to dedicate a work of art.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.44,1:06:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,卡拉?布罗迪，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Carla Brody,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.23,1:06:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一个名声越来越大的艺术家，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}an artist of growing reputation,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.23,1:06:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,被委托表达 我们永久的生活方式\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}was commissioned to express our way of life in permanent form...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.66,1:07:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,向世界展示我们所知道的 就在这个海滩上\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}to show the world what we all know right here on this beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.41,1:07:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,巴哈马更好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That it is better in the Bahamas.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.46,1:07:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-当然 -女士们先生们，卡拉?布罗迪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Absolutely. - Ladies and gentlemen, Carla Brody!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.67,1:07:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，威瑟斯彭局长， 威瑟斯彭太太\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thank you, Commissioner Witherspoon, Mrs Witherspoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.18,1:07:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.82,1:07:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.86,1:07:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.99,1:07:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！回来！把她带回来！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Stop! Come back! Bring her back!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.41,1:07:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.60,1:08:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！西娅！西娅！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Stop! Thea! Thea!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.43,1:08:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.81,1:08:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有人做点什么！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Somebody do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.02,1:08:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.45,1:08:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，不！天哪！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, no! My God!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.79,1:08:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈妈！妈妈！ -西娅！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Mommy! Mommy! - Thea!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.97,1:08:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,快去找医生！ 快叫医生来！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Somebody get a doctor! Get a doctor now!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.80,1:08:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,迅速地！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.45,1:09:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-对不起，我想你了 -你去哪儿了？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I'm sorry I missed you. - Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.83,1:09:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？怎么搞的？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What's the matter? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.96,1:09:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,西娅被鲨鱼袭击了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thea was attacked by a shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.13,1:10:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，天哪\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.22,1:10:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,医生说她应该没事 她很震惊\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The doctor said she should be OK. She's in shock.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.26,1:10:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的？亲爱的？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sweetheart? Sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.14,1:10:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 我早该知道的上帝啊\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm so sorry. I should've known. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.27,1:10:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,应该知道什么吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Should've known what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.81,1:10:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们试图跟踪他 -的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- We tried to keep track of him. - Of...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.52,1:10:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The shark.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.53,1:10:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-你知道吗？ -是的以为它消失了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You knew? - Yeah. Thought it went away.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.24,1:10:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-在我后面 -她可能已经被杀了你知道吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Came after me. - She could've been killed. You knew?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.37,1:10:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有告诉我们？ 你让你妈妈想\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}And you didn't tell us? You let your mother think...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.58,1:10:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.87,1:10:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-你怎么能这么做？ -我妈妈在哪里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- How could you do that? - Where's my mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.67,1:10:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-我妈妈在哪里？ -你为什么不告诉我们？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Where's my mother? - Why didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.29,1:10:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-杰克在哪里？ -你为什么不告诉我们？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Where's Jake? - WHY DIDN'T YOU TELL US?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.88,1:10:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.26,1:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.85,1:10:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-杰克！ -什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Jake! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.43,1:10:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！我需要你！快点！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come on! I need you! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.91,1:11:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,霍吉！你看到我们的船了吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hoagie! Did you see our boat?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.92,1:11:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-我刚到这里 -我妈妈拿走了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I just got here. - My mother took it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.92,1:11:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-我希望她是个好水手 -一条鲨鱼袭击了西娅\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- I hope she's a good sailor. - A shark attacked Thea.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.92,1:11:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她去追那该死的东西\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}She went after the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.09,1:11:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-她在追吗？ -是的，我们得阻止她\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- She's gone after it? - Yeah, we gotta stop her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.60,1:11:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里面？ 在浴缸里呆一整天\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}In that? Lt'll take all day in that bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.56,1:11:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有更好的主意吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.57,1:11:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我会用无线电通知她的位置\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'll radio her position.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.23,1:11:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,救援船会来接她， 所以不要担心\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}The rescue boats will pick her up, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.57,1:11:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,她会没事的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.82,1:11:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她永远也找不到那条该死的鲨鱼 我们不能\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}She'll never find that bloody shark. We couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.95,1:11:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,它会找到她的 什么意思？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It'll find her. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.20,1:11:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她说要来了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}She said it was coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.04,1:12:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-你什么意思？ -你知道什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- What do you mean? - What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.42,1:12:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她认为鲨鱼 他杀了马丁和肖恩\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}She thinks the shark that killed Martin and Sean
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.88,1:12:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,正在跟踪家人\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}is following the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.59,1:12:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，他不说话 关于我们的鲨鱼，嗯？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey, he's not talkin' about our shark, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.01,1:12:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候做 你不是开飞机的人吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What do you do when you're not flying people?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.10,1:12:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我送洗好的衣服\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I deliver laundry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.10,1:12:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等等那是什么？ 让我们看看\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hold on. What's that? Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.28,1:12:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.57,1:12:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,外面是一片大海\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's a big ocean out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.99,1:13:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西能不能再快一点？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Can't this thing go any faster?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.57,1:13:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,再快一点，这个东西 飞翔的翠鸟\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Any faster, this thing'll be a flying Cuisinart
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.74,1:13:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会被抛在脑后\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}and we'll be diced into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.98,1:13:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来接我， 你这狗娘养的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come and get me, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.57,1:13:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,她来了 她就在那儿\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There she is. That's her right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.70,1:14:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是这么想的吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.54,1:14:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈妈 -等等！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Mom... - Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.55,1:14:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.24,1:14:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,托马斯，你在吗？ 这里是零阿尔法爸爸\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Thomas, you there? This is Zero-Papa-Alpha here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.03,1:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,霍吉，你在哪儿？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hoagie, where are you? 
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.33,1:14:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,距离翡翠公园东南12英里 寻找海王星的愚蠢\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}12 miles southeast of Emerald Key. Look for Neptune's Folly.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.71,1:14:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要两艘快艇 谁能杀死鲨鱼 一条大鲨鱼\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I need two boats fast and somebody who can kill a shark, a big one.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.50,1:14:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么？ 练习着着陆\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What're you doing?  Practising landing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.76,1:14:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们，抓紧你们的袜子\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hang on to your socks, lads.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.30,1:14:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等待！你确定你知道 怎么做？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Wait! You sure you know how to do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.01,1:15:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不是！ 你认为我是什么样的飞行员？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Of course not! What kind of pilot do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.86,1:15:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-天哪！ -见鬼，还不错\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Christ! - Hell, not half bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.87,1:15:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,出去，我会让它忙个不停的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Get out, I'll keep it busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.91,1:15:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不，它会来接飞机的 电磁脉冲\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No, it'll come for the plane's electromagnetic impulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.12,1:15:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出去！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Get the bloody hell out!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.83,1:15:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.47,1:15:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的乘客！你还是老样子 抱怨，抱怨\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Damn passengers! You're all the same. Complain, complain...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.10,1:15:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，该死！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.15,1:15:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,霍吉！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hoagie!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.19,1:15:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,霍吉！霍吉！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hoagie! Hoagie!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.01,1:16:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Why'd you come out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.31,1:16:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Why'd you come out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.02,1:16:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-你为什么带他来？ -妈妈，妈妈！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Why did you bring him? - Mom, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.31,1:16:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-你为什么要坐船？ -它一直在来！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Why'd you take the boat? - It kept coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.27,1:16:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没有意识到吗？ -没有别的事可做\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Didn't you realise? - There was nothing else to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.86,1:16:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不应该这么做的 -我想告诉你\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- You shouldn't have done it. - I tried to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.24,1:16:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我试过了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.45,1:16:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿！ 看在上帝的份上，帮我一把！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hey! Give me a hand, for Christ's sake!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.50,1:16:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-霍吉！ -你是怎么做到的，伙计？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Hoagie! - How the hell did you do that, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.62,1:16:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-相信我，这不容易 -把他扶起来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- It wasn't easy, believe me. - Get him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.88,1:17:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧，伙计？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You all right, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.05,1:17:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦！该死的 -开始吧！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Oh! Bloody hell. - Get it started!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.47,1:17:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-那东西上的气！ -你还活着！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- The breath on that thing! - You are alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.60,1:17:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们离开这里， 埃伦?布罗迪哦！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Let's get out of here, Ellen Brody. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.18,1:17:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，这个东西还在用\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Good, this thing's still working.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.69,1:17:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的引擎，伙计 我去看看\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That's your engine, pal. I'll have a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.82,1:17:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，妈的，他离我们很近，伙计\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Oh, shit, he's close, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.15,1:17:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是什么声音？ -鲨鱼的心跳\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- What is that sound? - The shark's heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.45,1:17:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,霍吉，试着说完 迈克尔，帮我个忙，我有个主意\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hoagie, try to finish. Michael, gimme a hand, I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.37,1:17:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里取水 艾伦，从这里开始抽\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're taking water down here. Ellen, start pumping here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.54,1:17:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,艾伦！把舱底泵拿来！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ellen! Get the bilge pump!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.63,1:17:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,取出无线电发射器 把它挂在频闪上\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Take the radio transmitter out and hook it to the strobe.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.26,1:17:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们得发动引擎！ -就这么做！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- We gotta get the engine started! - Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.89,1:17:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要喂那个大男孩 一顿他赢了的饭\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're gonna feed that big boy a meal he won't forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.01,1:17:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好做点好事 我们的水管坏了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You better have something good going. We've got a rotten hose.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.56,1:17:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个备用的 你想怎么处理这个？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There's a spare one. What you wanna do with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.02,1:18:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我在操做接收器我们明白了 在那个混蛋里面引爆它\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I'm riggin' the receiver. We get it inside that bastard and set it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.32,1:18:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我得到了它我们在上面装了天线， 我们可以把他吓跑\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I got it. We rig an antenna on this, we can shock the hell out of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.49,1:18:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,正确的！你在重新学习\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Right! You're learning.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.45,1:18:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他越来越近了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}He's getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.04,1:18:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他们一生都在寻找 食物，他们不在乎它是什么\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}They spend their lives looking for food, they don't care what it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.92,1:18:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他消化不良 他吃了我的飞机！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Maybe he's got indigestion. He's eaten my plane!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.92,1:18:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他要的不是食物\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's not food he's after.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.17,1:18:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，打开开关 我需要一个测试\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, turn on your switch. I need a test.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.18,1:18:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-有人告诉你你疯了吗？ -一直如此\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Anybody tell you you're nuts? - All the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.22,1:18:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果它有反应 对于外部电脉冲，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}If it responds to external electrical impulse,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.35,1:18:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,它可能对里面的一个有反应，迷惑他，把他逼疯\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}it might respond to one inside, confuse him, drive him crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.27,1:18:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，一个测试很好\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}OK, a test... Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.03,1:18:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好上来！ 心跳停止了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You'd better get up here! The heartbeat's stopped!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.58,1:18:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,倒霉\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.29,1:18:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要么他走了 或者你的装备又坏了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Either he's gone or your gear's crapped out again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.04,1:19:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那是最牛的我的设备 不要废话他会回来的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}That's bull. My equipment don't crap out. He'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.51,1:19:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把船钩给我\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Get me the boat hook.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.34,1:19:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他心脏病发作了 人类富含胆固醇\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Maybe he had a heart attack. Humans are full of cholesterol.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.18,1:19:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-把那个给我 -妈的！他在哪里？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Give me that. - Shit! Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.48,1:19:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把电话给我，迈克尔 就在那里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Give me that line, Michael. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.61,1:19:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.03,1:19:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,艾伦，试试引擎\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ellen, try the engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.99,1:19:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,艾伦！试着发动引擎！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ellen! Try to start the engine!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.25,1:19:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的 让我们离开这里\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Son of a bitch. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.42,1:19:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不，太晚了，霍吉 给我一个硬端口\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No, it's too late, Hoagie. Give me a hard port.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.67,1:19:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,正确的！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.51,1:19:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,给，给我 不！没时间了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Here, give me that. No! No time for that!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.43,1:19:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克你不能出去 没有线！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake! You can't go out there without a line!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.27,1:19:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,保持稳定 它会回来的！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Keep it steady. It's gonna come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.49,1:20:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的东西消失了他走了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Damn thing's disappeared. He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.53,1:21:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.15,1:21:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们喝太多水了 它会使发动机熄火\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're taking too much water. It'll stop the engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.49,1:21:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,艾伦，开车 我们必须超越它艾伦！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ellen, take the wheel. We've got to outrun it. Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.76,1:21:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-那东西能用吗？ -它会起作用的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- That thing gonna work? - It'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.64,1:22:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,如果杰克这么说，它会的 这项指控会把它逼疯的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}If Jake says so, it will. This charge will drive it crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.04,1:23:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的耶稣， 我们直接去了！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Sweet Jesus, we're headed straight for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.29,1:23:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,艾伦，过来！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Ellen, come about!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.84,1:23:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会成功的！ 等等！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We're gonna hit it! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.64,1:23:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.39,1:23:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,笑一笑，你这个狗娘养的！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Smile, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.21,1:23:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-迈克尔！ -过来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Michael! - Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.63,1:23:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.13,1:24:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系！我没事！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's all right! I'm OK!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.93,1:24:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗？在这里！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Anybody there? Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.52,1:24:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.44,1:24:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克尔，你有空吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Michael, you got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.23,1:24:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是杰克！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}It's Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.66,1:24:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的！\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.63,1:24:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪，杰克\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Jesus, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.13,1:24:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么花了这么长时间，伙计？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What took you so damn long, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.01,1:24:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你还活着干什么？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}What the hell are you doing alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.56,1:24:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你杰克叔叔 设备不用废掉，是吧？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I told you Uncle Jake's equipment don't crap out, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.27,1:24:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会做什么的 像死在我身上一样愚蠢，是吗？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You're not going to do something stupid like die on me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.36,1:25:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不，伙计我太刻薄了\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}No, man. I'm way too mean for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.20,1:25:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所以从现在开始， 我们要研究蜗牛，嗯？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}So from now on, we're going to study snails, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.46,1:25:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.84,1:25:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,今年夏天来和睦家吧\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Come to Amity this summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.38,1:25:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会到的 你一定要让他们来\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}We'll be there. You make sure they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.63,1:25:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的 奶奶，我会想你的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I will. I'll miss you, Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.10,1:25:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,上车，艾伦?布罗迪 你会误机的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Get in, Ellen Brody. You'll miss your plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.18,1:25:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-再见，奶奶！ -好的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Goodbye, Grandma! - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.85,1:25:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-小心点 -好的再见\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Be careful. - OK. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.36,1:25:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-好好照顾杰克 -我会的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Take good care of Jake. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.32,1:25:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没事吧？\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}You gonna be OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.03,1:25:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的 -好的\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}- Yeah. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.99,1:25:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,当我回来的时候， 提醒我告诉你时间\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}When I come back, remind me to tell you about the time
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.83,1:25:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了一百个修女去了内罗毕\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}I took a hundred nuns to Nairobi.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.88,1:26:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在那里， 100个修女，弹吉他\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}There they were, 100 nuns, playing guitars
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.72,1:26:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,唱着“山还活着” 伴随着音乐的声音\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}and singing, "The hills are alive with the sound of music."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.85,1:26:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,突然间， 一个走到我面前，她说，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}Then suddenly, one comes up to me and she says,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.68,1:26:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,“烟来了 从发动机上”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}"There's smoke coming from the engine."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.81,1:26:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但我从来没有 认真对待他们，\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}But I never took them seriously,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.73,1:26:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,直到他们都开始唱歌:“我的上帝离你更近一点”\N{\fnSimSun\fs8\1c&H80FFFF&\b0}until they all started singing "Nearer My God to Thee."
